        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "パンは長すぎたので、乾燥してカチカチになっていた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash-lite"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "乾燥させた後、粘土はカチカチになった。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash-lite"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "庭仕事で一日中働いたせいで、彼の両手はカチカチだった。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash-lite"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 4,
        "gloss": "hidebound",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
